window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Book 2 of The Annals of the Draconians continues onward on the rich and mysterious planet of Alorenia. The elven planet. The political parties try to forge an agreement for the elves to join Phaetos, while the reclusive elves try to make the path as difficult as possible. In tandem, the Draconians learn from each other and the elves as they fight off the waves of Drakions and prepare for a potential assault by their dark brethren. In the meantime, the newly promoted Temporian Promothon scours Phaetos in search of the elusive sleepers and the portal that they managed to successfully sneak into the alliance. Even with all the danger, Ahzurin is distracted by and enamored of his bonded. Not one but two. He is forced to juggle their affection with his preparation for a deadly encounter.</p> <p><b>About the Series:</b></p> <p>Immerse yourself in an epic adventure across space and time, and among creatures large and small. This manifested existence encompasses dragons, elves, magically-infused humanoids, galactic travel, advanced technology, and dreaded Draconians (dragons masquerading around as humanoids). Experience the creation from multiple perspectives, in detail. Some persevere throughout the series, others not so much.</p> <p>An unfettered creation from an unchained mind.</p> <p><b>Genre:</b> Epic Fantasy, Science Fiction, Romantasy, Dark Romance, Erotica.</p> <p><b>Completeness:</b> An on-going series.</p> <p><b>Language:</b> Written in American English... with some infusions.</p>"; 
